{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
To load the module at boot, add this to /boot/loader.conf:

    intel_rapl_load="YES"

The upstream writable power controls have known limitations: large power
limits can wrap, concurrent changes can overwrite one another, and some
time-window values can be calculated incorrectly. Exercise caution when
changing these controls. See intel_rapl(4) for usage.
EOM
}
]
